# SPA fallback for hosts that don't already have this configured elsewhere in the
# hosting panel: serves 404.html (see scripts/prerender.mjs) for any path with no
# matching file — every route this app has other than '/', i.e. '/admin' — so a direct
# link or refresh on it boots the app instead of a bare host error page. Apache-only;
# inert (and harmless) on anything else, same as GitHub Pages' equivalent, native
# handling of a root-level 404.html.
ErrorDocument 404 /404.html
